{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"1CH","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"历代志上","commonName":"历代志上","title":"历代志上","order":13,"numberOfChapters":29,"sha256":"fc4564236e3ad71076ed44b678c67d6581a3c5d084477a871eeffdf3670ae182","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":29,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/29.json","totalNumberOfVerses":938},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["攻取拉巴"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["第二年春天，在列王出征的时节，约押率领军兵去毁坏亚扪人的土地，然后围攻拉巴，将城摧毁。当时，大卫在耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["大卫夺取了亚扪王头上的金冠。这金冠重达三十四公斤，上面还镶着宝石，人们将它戴在大卫头上。大卫从城里获得许多战利品，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他把城里的人带出来，命他们用锯、铁耙和斧头做工。他用同样的方式对待亚扪其他城邑的居民。之后，大卫和全军返回耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["打败非利士巨人"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["这事以后，以色列人又在基色与非利士人交战。户沙人西比该杀死一个叫细派的巨人后裔，非利士人被征服。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["在与非利士人的另一次交战中，雅珥的儿子伊勒哈难杀了迦特人歌利亚的兄弟拉哈米，拉哈米的枪杆粗如织布机的轴。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["此后，在迦特又起了战事，那里有个身材高大的人，是巨人的后代。他每只手和脚各有六个手指和脚趾，共二十四个手指和脚趾。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["他向以色列人骂阵，大卫的哥哥示米亚的儿子约拿单就杀了他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["这三个迦特巨人的后裔都死在大卫和他的部下手里。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/1CH/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}